---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import TerminalWindow from '../components/TerminalWindow.astro';
---

<Layout title="Its me Edu | duzera blog" description="Sobre mim - Eduardo, desenvolvedor e entusiasta de tecnologia.">
  <div class="container">
    <section class="about-section">
      <header class="about-header">
        <div class="header-prompt">
          <span class="text-muted">&gt;</span>
          <span class="text-cyan">cat</span>
          <span>./about.md</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="about-title">
          <span class="text-green">Its me Edu</span>
          <span class="cursor"></span>
        </h1>
      </header>

      <TerminalWindow title="~/about.md">
        <div class="about-content">
          <div class="intro-line">
            <span class="text-muted">&gt;</span>
            <span class="text-cyan">echo</span>
            <span class="text-yellow">"Olá, mundo!"</span>
          </div>

          <div class="bio">
            <p>
              Sou o <strong class="text-green">Edu</strong>, um desenvolvedor apaixonado por
              código limpo, sistemas bem arquitetados e aquele café forte que
              mantém a criatividade fluindo.
            </p>

            <p>
              Este blog é o <span class="text-cyan">duzera blog</span> — meu espaço
              onde compartilho pensamentos sobre tecnologia, programação e as
              aventuras do dia a dia de quem vive entre terminais e IDEs.
            </p>

            <h2>
              <span class="text-muted">##</span>
              <span class="text-green">Filosofia</span>
            </h2>

            <blockquote>
              "Código é poesia, e todo bug é apenas uma rima que ainda não encontrou seu verso."
            </blockquote>

            <p>
              Acredito em aprendizado contínuo, comunidade open source e
              que a melhor forma de crescer é compartilhando conhecimento.
            </p>

            <h2>
              <span class="text-muted">##</span>
              <span class="text-green">Contato</span>
            </h2>

            <div class="contact-section">
              <div class="contact-line">
                <span class="text-muted">&gt;</span>
                <span class="text-cyan">email:</span>
                <a href="mailto:eduardosilva07.js@gmail.com">eduardosilva07.js@gmail.com</a>
              </div>
              <div class="contact-line">
                <span class="text-muted">&gt;</span>
                <span class="text-cyan">github:</span>
                <a href="https://github.com/eduardonk9999" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@eduardonk9999</a>
              </div>
              <div class="contact-line">
                <span class="text-muted">&gt;</span>
                <span class="text-cyan">linkedin:</span>
                <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/eduardo-alves-537963160/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Eduardo Alves</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="outro-line">
            <span class="text-muted">&gt;</span>
            <span class="text-green">exit 0</span>
            <span class="text-muted"># Até a próxima!</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </TerminalWindow>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-section {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
    animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease forwards;
  }

  .header-prompt {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
  }

  .about-title {
    font-size: var(--font-size-2xl);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .cursor {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 0.6em;
    height: 1em;
    background-color: var(--accent-green);
    animation: blink 1s infinite;
  }

  .about-content {
    animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease 0.2s forwards;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .intro-line {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
  }

  .bio {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .bio p {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .bio h2 {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
    margin-top: var(--spacing-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
    padding-top: var(--spacing-md);
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--text-muted);
  }

  .stack-section,
  .contact-section {
    margin: var(--spacing-md) 0;
    padding-left: var(--spacing-md);
  }

  .stack-line,
  .contact-line {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .bio blockquote {
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-lg);
    background-color: var(--bg-primary);
    border-radius: var(--border-radius);
  }

  .outro-line {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
    margin-top: var(--spacing-xl);
    padding-top: var(--spacing-lg);
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--text-muted);
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-title {
      font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
    }
  }
</style>
